## Section 1: Core Environment Setup

You can start building most StellarX Philippines projects without needing third-party API keys.

This guide is focused on:
- Stellar network setup
- testnet infrastructure
- protocol references
- auth and SDK patterns
- critical gotchas that can waste time during a build

### Protocol Access Overview

| Protocol / Tool | Key Required | Notes |
